{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56343","headline":"宿赤松会仙阁诗 · 袁吉","name":"宿赤松会仙阁诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道分相投气味长，就中何处最片忘？\n芙蓉阁上秋窗下，卧枕泉声并石牀。\n（均见光绪廿年刊邓锺玉撰《金华县志》卷二，次诗又见同书卷五。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁吉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56343.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56343","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}